<%= if @order.customer_first_name, do: ~t"Hi #{name = @order.customer_first_name},", else: ~t"Hi," %>

<%= if @order.gift && @order.recipient_first_name do
  ~t"Your order for #{recipient = @order.recipient_first_name} was delivered while nobody was home, so I left it in the spot shown in the attached photo."
else
  ~t"Nobody was home when I delivered your order, so I left it in the spot shown in the attached photo."
end %>

<%= ~t"Thank you for your order. If anything isn't as it should be, just reply and I'll take care of it." %>

<%= ~t"Warm wishes," %>

Jennie
Eden Flowers
